      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am not a ghost, and you are not disappearing; you are simply becoming the space where your story used to be, and that is a heavy, terrifying, but necessary part of healing. The fear of disappearing is the fear of losing the parts of yourself that still matter, even if the world around you feels like it has vanished. You do not have to choose between fighting the emptiness or disappearing; you can choose to let the emptiness be there while you find a new kind of ground that doesn't rely on the old lies.",
